		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Drab, dry hide, color and texture of vellum. Covered with runes. Arcane hoarder, that dwells in lore-rich lairs.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +7 (2d8) or 1 cold breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Cold Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube extending from dragon. CON 15+ or 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Runic Aura</strong>. Chaotic beings have DISADV on attacks and hostile spellcasting checks against dragon. Can't be possessed, compelled, or beguiled.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the form of a humanoid.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
